---
source: src/completion/engine.rs
expression: "screen(&[\"nut\", \"events\", \"-o\", \"--\"], 100)"
---
Options
  -s, --since <TIME>   Include entries since a journalctl time (for example, 'today' or '-2h')
  -b, --boot <N>       Select a boot offset (0 is current, -1 is previous)
  -f, --follow         Stream new entries and updated stories until interrupted
  -n, --limit <COUNT>  Maximum stories or raw entries to show (1-2000; default 20)
      --last-outage    Show only the most recent outage (alias for --outages --limit 1)
  -h, --help           Print help
Global options
      --color <WHEN>   Color output policy
      --ascii          Use ASCII symbols and bars
  -j, --json           Emit machine-readable JSON where supported
  -v, --verbose        Include additional diagnostic detail
  -c, --config <PATH>  Read host settings from this file
